@startuml
title REST indexing and statistics
actor Client
participant IndexController
participant SearchService
participant DatasetLoader
participant IndexBuilder
participant StatsController
Client -> IndexController: POST /api/index {threads: N}
IndexController -> SearchService: index(request)
SearchService -> SearchService: validate N (1..64); serialize rebuilds
SearchService -> DatasetLoader: load(configured path)
DatasetLoader --> SearchService: immutable documents
SearchService -> IndexBuilder: buildParallel(documents, N)
alt success
 IndexBuilder --> SearchService: completed BuildSnapshot
 SearchService -> SearchService: publish State(build, documents, uniqueTerms)
 SearchService --> Client: 200 StatsResponse
else failure
 SearchService --> Client: 500 dataset error / 503 build error
 note right of SearchService: Previous State remains available
end
Client -> StatsController: GET /api/stats
StatsController -> SearchService: stats()
SearchService -> SearchService: capture one State
SearchService --> Client: 200 StatsResponse
@enduml
